{"accession_number": "0001193125-26-215875", "chunk_id": "V-000119312526215875-d59695dex991-htm-0d19712ce6903ada-chunk-0008-00cfe603ae499988ae26f582", "chunk_text": "Class B: 3\ncommon stock;\n\n\u2022\n\napproximately 23.3 million shares of Class C common stock; and \n\n\u2022\n\nin lieu of issuing fractional shares, Visa will pay cash based on the reported closing Class A common stock\nprice on the NYSE as of the expiration date of $318.79. \n\nThe accepted stock includes approximately 98 percent of outstanding", "cik": "0001403161", "document_id": "V-000119312526215875-d59695dex991-htm-0d19712ce6903ada", "document_role": "exhibit", "end_offset": 1227, "exhibit_type": "PRESS_RELEASE", "filed_at": "2026-05-11T13:10:25+00:00", "filing_date": "2026-05-11", "form_type": "EX-99", "item_number": "", "local_path": "C:\\Users\\aruba\\.buzz\\REPOS\\filings-market-intelligence\\data\\filings\\raw\\V\\000119312526215875\\d59695dex991.htm", "metadata": {"chunker_version": "sec_aware_v2", "content_hash": "84097d5e9f057aa257707c25e7bf056b52a741a33f65accee1c755cab1771579", "description": "EX-99.1", "document_name": "d59695dex991.htm", "item_number": "", "parser_version": "sec_text_v1", "report_date": "2026-05-11", "section_parser_version": "sec_sections_v3", "section_path": "Speaker: Class B", "speaker_name": "Class B", "speaker_role": ""}, "period_end": "2026-05-11", "section_path": "Speaker: Class B", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1403161/000119312526215875/d59695dex991.htm", "speaker_name": "Class B", "speaker_role": "", "start_offset": 897, "ticker": "V", "token_count": 56}
{"accession_number": "0001193125-26-215875", "chunk_id": "V-000119312526215875-d59695dex991-htm-0d19712ce6903ada-chunk-0009-27ffd4a8e8224d31200cbde9", "chunk_text": "Class B: 1 and B-2 shares, representing approximately 55 percent of outstanding Class B-1 shares and over 99 percent of outstanding Class B-2 shares. Settlement of the exchange will be made promptly. \n\nAbout Visa \n\nVisa (NYSE: V) is a world leader in digital\npayments, facilitating transactions between consumers, sellers, financial institutions and government entities across more than 200 countries and territories. Our mission is to connect the world through the most innovative, convenient, reliable and\nsecure payments network, enabling individuals, businesses and economies to thrive. We believe that economies that include everyone everywhere, uplift everyone everywhere and see access as foundational to the future of money movement. Learn more at\n\nVisa.com\n. \n\nAdditional Information and Where to Find It \n\nThe Exchange Offer was made solely by the Prospectus. Visa has also filed with the SEC a Schedule TO, which contains important information about the Exchange\nOffer. Copies of the Prospectus, the Registration Statement, the Schedule TO, the Letter of Transmittal and other related documents, and any other information that Visa files electronically with the SEC, may be obtained free of charge at the\nSEC\u2019s website at www.sec.gov. \n\nVisa has engaged Equiniti Trust Company, LLC and Sodali & Co. to act respectively as exchange agent and\ninformation agent for the Exchange Offer. To obtain copies of the Prospectus, the Letter of Transmittal and other related documents and for questions about the terms of the Exchange Offer, you may contact the Information Agent toll-free at \n(800) 662-5200\n(for stockholders) or \n(203) 658-9400\n(for banks and brokers).\n\n1\n\nAs of the expiration date, the applicable Conversion Rate for the", "cik": "0001403161", "document_id": "V-000119312526215875-d59695dex991-htm-0d19712ce6903ada", "document_role": "exhibit", "end_offset": 2967, "exhibit_type": "PRESS_RELEASE", "filed_at": "2026-05-11T13:10:25+00:00", "filing_date": "2026-05-11", "form_type": "EX-99", "item_number": "", "local_path": "C:\\Users\\aruba\\.buzz\\REPOS\\filings-market-intelligence\\data\\filings\\raw\\V\\000119312526215875\\d59695dex991.htm", "metadata": {"chunker_version": "sec_aware_v2", "content_hash": "84097d5e9f057aa257707c25e7bf056b52a741a33f65accee1c755cab1771579", "description": "EX-99.1", "document_name": "d59695dex991.htm", "item_number": "", "parser_version": "sec_text_v1", "report_date": "2026-05-11", "section_parser_version": "sec_sections_v3", "section_path": "Speaker: Class B", "speaker_name": "Class B", "speaker_role": ""}, "period_end": "2026-05-11", "section_path": "Speaker: Class B", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1403161/000119312526215875/d59695dex991.htm", "speaker_name": "Class B", "speaker_role": "", "start_offset": 1227, "ticker": "V", "token_count": 266}
